vatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1915,"digest":"sha256:fe5d0c4c624e2ae2b069412f362b678046621f0c547ab1965b2b714131ecdb9e","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-09-22T20:31:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T20:31:13Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.84.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.84.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.84.0","body":"## RevealLine v0.84.0 — unified mission library\n\nSolo, Versus and Team now use one native mission browser for Journey, Classic and Custom content. Search, filters and tags expose compatible missions without query parameters. Launches retain exact edition identity, optional content uses explicit prepare/cancel/retry and Stay/Replace decisions, focus and scroll return to the initiating card, and authored Next sequences continue in the selected edition. Custom raster evidence covers partial capture in Solo and both Versus boards. This release adds no campaign missions or artwork.\n\nSource: `1107f570508e0d107440236b6aeedbce8506cd7d` (tree `793ee7e682e206e0914754cf60fd93af0792c463`), merged through [PR #268](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/268).\n\nThe actual merged-source [qualification and freeze](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35779409329) passed source identity, validation, lint, formatting, native formatting, motion syntax, production reproduction/readiness and the immutable freeze. Automated suites were explicitly waived under the temporary reviewed policy; no passing automated-test verdict is claimed. The preceding [PR build](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35778248160) passed its preflight and ordinary production build with the same waiver recorded.\n\nThe guarded read-only [artifact inspection](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/35780429336) verified every Git source blob/type/mode and source TAR commit, every distribution manifest byte and hash chain, and the bounded offline inventory. The shipped manifest contains the exact frozen distribution graph.\n\nOriginal distribution: 591,009,653 bytes, SHA-256 `923d5588b2ab6d3223546ab73fc6247b32fb0152153a13f6d1e6e7341062725f`.\n\nOriginal source archive: 1,607,782,400 bytes, SHA-256 `0cbec5f398e0b5951951515fe6282b0789d9848142d4aeaebcc0fa98a7f65f88`.\n\nPages selection, public byte verification and affected browser journeys remain separate acceptance gates until the selector PR is merged and the deployed site is checked. Physical controllers, physical touch, cold-offline use, full campaign balance and musical/listening acceptance are not claimed by this release package.\n"}